# ✨🐾 Pet The Animals 🐾✨

Have you ever wandered through the lands of **Gielinor** and thought, *"That cow looks like it deserves a good head scratch"*?  
Or perhaps you’ve passed by a penguin spy and whispered, *"You’re doing great, comrade"*?  
Well adventurer, your wholesome dreams are about to come true!

**Pet The Animals** is a charming RuneLite plugin that gifts you the magical ability to right-click and **"Pet"** a delightful selection of passive NPCs — from loyal dogs and mischievous cats, to fluffy sheep, regal camels, and undercover penguins. 🐧

✨ **Features:**
- Adds an immersive **"Pet"** interaction to friendly, non-aggressive NPCs.
- Over **dozens of unique, lore-rich, and meme-worthy responses** for each animal.
- Perfect for roleplay, screenshots, streaming, or simply spreading a little joy in Gielinor.
- Built to respect RuneLite & Jagex guidelines — wholesome fun only!

Whether you’re pausing between boss fights, waiting for your farming patch to grow, or just feeling the need to share some love with the critters of the world, **Pet The Animals** is your ultimate wholesome side-quest. 💖

---
*Go forth, adventurer — and may your pets be plentiful and your messages be meme-worthy!*